			"notes": "# :drop_of_blood: Builder's Delight v1.1.4 — The Corruption Update\n\n> Released on **2025-11-12**\n\n---\n\n## :new: New Features\n- **:wood: Pillar Log Blocks**  \n  Added fully **directional pillar variants** for all standard wood types.  \n  These can be placed and rotated in **any direction**, perfect for detailed and creative builds.\n- **:cd: New Music Discs**  \n  Introduced **5 new custom discs**, each with unique, atmospheric tracks to deepen the world’s ambience.\n- **:new_moon: Custom Dimension: The Corrupted Wastes**  \n  A bleak, color-drained realm that mirrors the overworld in decay.  \n  The land is stripped of life and color — a desolate place touched by corruption.\n\n---\n\n## :repeat: Changes\n- Reworked and balanced **multiple crafting recipes** for smoother progression.\n- Updated **textures and item models** for greater visual consistency.\n- Adjusted **world generation logic** to support dimension-related changes.\n\n---\n\n## :beetle: Fixes\n- Fixed **log rotation and placement issues** for new pillar variants.\n- Corrected **item and block tags** for improved mod compatibility.\n- General **code cleanup** and small optimization tweaks.\n\n---\n\n## :gear: Technical\n- Refactored **registry system** to better support future expansion.\n- Improved **asset and data loading** for the new dimension and custom music.\n\n---\n\n_Thanks for playing and supporting development!  \nYour feedback helps the mod grow stronger with every update._\nlink: https://github.com/MineGuy0/Builders_Delight/releases/tag/beta-1.1.4"
		},
